<?xpacket begin="ï»¿" id="W5M0MpCehiHzreSzNTczkc9d"?>
<x:xmpmeta xmlns:x="adobe:ns:meta/">
  <rdf:RDF xmlns:rdf="http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#">
    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Legends of Brightmoon</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After her baby daughter, the Princess Glimmer, is abducted by Shadow Weaver and cannot be recovered, Queen Angella takes an orphaned magicat as her ward, naming her Catra. Meanwhile, Glimmer is raised alongside Adora in the Fright Zone.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;When Catra and her best friend, Bow, find Adora and a mysterious sword in the Whispering Woods, nothing will ever be the same for any of them...and Catra will need to figure out who she truly, deep down, wants to be.&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>CountDorku</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
